<title>USA: No. Harris Mont. CCD, Texas, $2.180 mln won by.</title>
<headline>No. Harris Mont. CCD, Texas, $2.180 mln won by.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Rauscher Pierce said it won $2.180 million of North Harris Montgomery CCD, Texas, limited tax contractual obligations, Series 1997, with a true interest cost of 4.35 percent.</p>
